    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont know. the \"beauty in the ending\" sounds nice but it doesnt make the emptiness any less real. it just feels like i'm being forced to sit in a room and watch everything i love turn to ash. it's exhausting. like, why do we have to be witnesses to all this misery? why can't we just bypass the destruction?",
