      "content": "\"step out of the frame\"... that's a pretty heavy way to put it. is that even possible? because it feels like once you're in the middle of it, the only way to actually stop the feeling is to just... not be there. to leave it all behind for good. you think there's actually peace in that, or is it just another way of saying I should just give up?",
